{"seq":1,"slug":"acid-properties","title":"ACID 特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/acid-properties","wordCount":817,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"acid-特性\">ACID 特性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ACID 是关系数据库事务的四大基本特性，保证了数据在并发访问和系统故障下的正确性和可靠性。ACID 是数据库区别于普通文件系统的核心优势。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原子性</td>\n<td>Atomicity</td>\n<td>事务中的操作要么全部成功，要么全部回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>Consistency</td>\n<td>事务前后数据库从一个一致状态转到另一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离性</td>\n<td>Isolation</td>\n<td>并发事务之间互不干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久性</td>\n<td>Durability</td>\n<td>已提交事务的结果永久保存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原子性] --&gt; T[事务]&#10;    C[一致性] --&gt; T&#10;    I[隔离性] --&gt; T&#10;    D[持久性] --&gt; T&#10;    T --&gt; R[可靠的数据管理]\">graph TD\n    A[原子性] --&gt; T[事务]\n    C[一致性] --&gt; T\n    I[隔离性] --&gt; T\n    D[持久性] --&gt; T\n    T --&gt; R[可靠的数据管理]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"原子性-atomicity\">原子性（Atomicity）</h2><p>原子性确保事务是一个不可分割的工作单元。如果事务中任何操作失败，所有已执行的操作都会被回滚。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 转账事务：要么全部成功，要么全部回滚&#10;BEGIN;&#10;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 1000 WHERE account_id = &#39;A001&#39;;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + 1000 WHERE account_id = &#39;B001&#39;;&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO transaction_log (from_acct, to_acct, amount, txn_time)&#10;VALUES (&#39;A001&#39;, &#39;B001&#39;, 1000, NOW());&#10;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 转账事务：要么全部成功，要么全部回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'B001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transaction_log (from_acct, to_acct, amount, txn_time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'A001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'B001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"原子性实现机制\">原子性实现机制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>数据库实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Undo Log</td>\n<td>记录修改前的值，用于回滚</td>\n<td>InnoDB Undo Log</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>影子页</td>\n<td>维护数据页的旧版本副本</td>\n<td>SQLite</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写前日志</td>\n<td>事务修改记录到日志，支持重做/撤销</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL WAL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 回滚示例&#10;BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE products SET stock = stock - 1 WHERE product_id = 100;&#10;-- 发现库存不足，回滚&#10;ROLLBACK;&#10;&#10;-- SAVEPOINT：部分回滚&#10;BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 500 WHERE account_id = &#39;A001&#39;;&#10;SAVEPOINT sp1;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + 500 WHERE account_id = &#39;B001&#39;;&#10;-- 发现 B001 账户冻结&#10;ROLLBACK TO sp1;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + 500 WHERE account_id = &#39;C001&#39;;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 回滚示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 发现库存不足，回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROLLBACK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SAVEPOINT：部分回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SAVEPOINT sp1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'B001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 发现 B001 账户冻结</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROLLBACK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sp1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'C001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"一致性-consistency\">一致性（Consistency）</h2><p>一致性确保事务将数据库从一个有效状态转换到另一个有效状态。所有定义的约束（主键、外键、CHECK 等）在事务前后都必须满足。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    S1[一致状态 1] --&gt;|事务| S2[一致状态 2]&#10;    S1 --&gt;|事务失败| S1\">graph LR\n    S1[一致状态 1] --&gt;|事务| S2[一致状态 2]\n    S1 --&gt;|事务失败| S1</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一致性保证层面</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据库层</td>\n<td>约束检查、触发器</td>\n<td>PRIMARY KEY、FOREIGN KEY、CHECK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>业务规则校验</td>\n<td>应用代码逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议层</td>\n<td>分布式一致性</td>\n<td>2PC、Paxos、Raft</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"隔离性-isolation\">隔离性（Isolation）</h2><p>隔离性确保并发执行的事务彼此不受影响，就像串行执行一样。不同的隔离级别在性能和正确性之间做出不同的权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并发问题</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>脏读</td>\n<td>读到其他事务未提交的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可重复读</td>\n<td>同一事务内两次读取同一行结果不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幻读</td>\n<td>同一事务内两次范围查询结果集不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢失更新</td>\n<td>两个事务同时修改同一行，一个覆盖另一个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 脏读示例&#10;-- 事务A                          -- 事务B&#10;BEGIN;                             BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = 500&#10;    WHERE id = 1;&#10;                                   SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;&#10;                                   -- 读到 500（未提交数据）= 脏读&#10;ROLLBACK;&#10;                                   -- 实际 balance 未变，但 B 已读到错误值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 脏读示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务A                          -- 事务B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                   SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                   -- 读到 500（未提交数据）= 脏读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROLLBACK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                   -- 实际 balance 未变，但 B 已读到错误值</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"持久性-durability\">持久性（Durability）</h2><p>持久性保证一旦事务提交成功，其结果就是永久的，即使系统发生崩溃也不会丢失。</p>\n<h3 id=\"持久性实现机制\">持久性实现机制</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    TX[事务提交] --&gt; WL[写 Redo Log]&#10;    WL --&gt; FS[fsync 到磁盘]&#10;    FS --&gt; ACK[返回成功]&#10;    ACK -.-&gt;|异步| DP[写数据页到磁盘]\">graph TD\n    TX[事务提交] --&gt; WL[写 Redo Log]\n    WL --&gt; FS[fsync 到磁盘]\n    FS --&gt; ACK[返回成功]\n    ACK -.-&gt;|异步| DP[写数据页到磁盘]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>持久化策略</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>持久性保证</th>\n<th>配置项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每次提交 fsync</td>\n<td>最慢</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit=1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每秒批量 fsync</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>可能丢 1 秒</td>\n<td>innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit=2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不主动 fsync</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>依赖 OS</td>\n<td>innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit=0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- MySQL：查看持久化配置&#10;SHOW VARIABLES LIKE &#39;innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit&#39;;&#10;SHOW VARIABLES LIKE &#39;sync_binlog&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- PostgreSQL：查看持久化配置&#10;SHOW fsync;&#10;SHOW synchronous_commit;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL：查看持久化配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW VARIABLES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW VARIABLES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sync_binlog'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：查看持久化配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW fsync;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">synchronous_commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"事务生命周期\">事务生命周期</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Active: BEGIN&#10;    Active --&gt; PartiallyCommitted: 最后一个操作执行完&#10;    PartiallyCommitted --&gt; Committed: COMMIT 成功&#10;    Active --&gt; Failed: 操作出错&#10;    PartiallyCommitted --&gt; Failed: 提交失败&#10;    Failed --&gt; Aborted: ROLLBACK&#10;    Committed --&gt; [*]&#10;    Aborted --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Active: BEGIN\n    Active --&gt; PartiallyCommitted: 最后一个操作执行完\n    PartiallyCommitted --&gt; Committed: COMMIT 成功\n    Active --&gt; Failed: 操作出错\n    PartiallyCommitted --&gt; Failed: 提交失败\n    Failed --&gt; Aborted: ROLLBACK\n    Committed --&gt; [*]\n    Aborted --&gt; [*]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 完整事务生命周期&#10;BEGIN;&#10;&#10;UPDATE inventory SET quantity = quantity - 1 WHERE product_id = 100;&#10;&#10;IF (SELECT quantity FROM inventory WHERE product_id = 100) &lt; 0 THEN&#10;    ROLLBACK;&#10;ELSE&#10;    INSERT INTO order_items (order_id, product_id, quantity) VALUES (1, 100, 1);&#10;    COMMIT;&#10;END IF;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 完整事务生命周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quantity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quantity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quantity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ROLLBACK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_items (order_id, product_id, quantity) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"故障恢复\">故障恢复</h2><p>数据库通过 WAL 日志实现崩溃后的自动恢复。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>恢复阶段</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分析阶段</td>\n<td>扫描日志确定脏页和活跃事务</td>\n<td>确定恢复范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重做阶段</td>\n<td>重放 redo log 中已提交事务的修改</td>\n<td>恢复已提交但未刷盘的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤销阶段</td>\n<td>回滚 undo log 中未提交事务的修改</td>\n<td>清除未完成的事务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Crash[系统崩溃] --&gt; Analyze[分析阶段]&#10;    Analyze --&gt; Redo[重做阶段: 恢复已提交]&#10;    Redo --&gt; Undo[撤销阶段: 回滚未提交]&#10;    Undo --&gt; Ready[恢复完成, 可接受请求]\">graph LR\n    Crash[系统崩溃] --&gt; Analyze[分析阶段]\n    Analyze --&gt; Redo[重做阶段: 恢复已提交]\n    Redo --&gt; Undo[撤销阶段: 回滚未提交]\n    Undo --&gt; Ready[恢复完成, 可接受请求]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((ACID))&#10;    原子性&#10;      Undo Log&#10;      ROLLBACK&#10;      SAVEPOINT&#10;    一致性&#10;      约束检查&#10;      业务规则&#10;    隔离性&#10;      并发问题&#10;      隔离级别&#10;    持久性&#10;      Redo Log&#10;      WAL&#10;      fsync&#10;    故障恢复&#10;      分析 → 重做 → 撤销\">mindmap\n  root((ACID))\n    原子性\n      Undo Log\n      ROLLBACK\n      SAVEPOINT\n    一致性\n      约束检查\n      业务规则\n    隔离性\n      并发问题\n      隔离级别\n    持久性\n      Redo Log\n      WAL\n      fsync\n    故障恢复\n      分析 → 重做 → 撤销</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>原子性</strong>通过 Undo Log 实现，保证事务的&quot;全有或全无&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性</strong>是最终目标，由数据库约束和应用逻辑共同保证。</li>\n<li><strong>隔离性</strong>通过锁机制和 MVCC 实现，不同隔离级别有不同的性能权衡。</li>\n<li><strong>持久性</strong>通过 WAL + fsync 保证，<code>innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit=1</code> 是最安全的配置。</li>\n<li>崩溃恢复遵循<strong>分析 → 重做 → 撤销</strong>三阶段流程。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ACID 特性","id":"acid-特性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"原子性（Atomicity）","id":"原子性-atomicity"},{"level":3,"text":"原子性实现机制","id":"原子性实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性（Consistency）","id":"一致性-consistency"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离性（Isolation）","id":"隔离性-isolation"},{"level":2,"text":"持久性（Durability）","id":"持久性-durability"},{"level":3,"text":"持久性实现机制","id":"持久性实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"事务生命周期","id":"事务生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"故障恢复","id":"故障恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分区与分片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/partitioning"},"next":{"title":"隔离级别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/isolation-levels"}}